[00:11.33] We sail through endless skies
[00:18.56] 
[00:20.65] Stars shine like eyes
[00:26.34] The black night sighs
[00:31.06] 
[00:34.11] The moon in silver trees
[00:43.47] Falls down in tears
[00:49.48] Light of the night
[00:55.17] The Earth, a purple blaze
[01:05.80] Of sapphire haze
[01:10.88] In orbit always
[01:15.60] 
[01:28.56] While down below the trees
[01:37.98] Bathed in cool breeze
[01:43.84] Silver starlight breaks down the night
[01:55.63] And so we pass on by the crimson eye
[02:10.62] Of great god Mars
[02:16.79] As we travel through the universe
[02:24.51] 